.eslintcache

# Texture packs such as Sphax PureBDCraft or Ashen are free to download but
# their licences forbid redistributing the files, so they must not be committed.
# Drop one here and point VITE_TEXTURE_PACK at it to use it locally.
client/public/texturepack/
